{"segs": ["PA_ja_129:0.2", "PA_ja_129:0.3"], "en": "The First Book, The Chapter on the Kusa Grass Reeds (Kusanāḷivagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_129:0.4"], "en": "9. The Aggikabhāradvāja Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_129:1.1"], "en": "“This crest is not for the sake of merit;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_129:1.2"], "en": "this crest is for the sake of food.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_129:1.3"], "en": "\"It does not even count as a finger's breadth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_129:1.4"], "en": "enough of this for you, O fire-worshipper!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_129:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the ninth Jātaka, the Aggikabhāradvāja Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
